e situazioni più assurde e più comiche che porteranno la sfortunata coppia in Iraq, proprio all'inizio del conflitto con gli americani. Attilio, senza conoscere una sola parola di arabo, inizia la sua guerra personale armato solo di poesia...","tagline":"Un poeta italiano innamorato è bloccato in Iraq all'inizio dell'invasione americana."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Tiger and the Snow","overview":"Love and injury in time of war. Attilio de Giovanni teaches poetry in Italy. He has a romantic soul, and women love him. But he is in love with Vittoria, and the love is unrequited. Every night he dreams of marrying her, in his boxer shorts and t-shirt, as Tom Waits sings. Vittoria travels to Iraq with her friend, Fuad, a poet; they are there with the second Gulf War breaks out. Vittoria is injured. Attilio must get to her side, and then, as war rages around him, he must find her the medical care she needs. In war, does love conquer all?","tagline":"A love-struck Italian poet is stuck in Iraq at the onset of an American invasion."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9ZNGlWhNhPwenG3Q6yNmSdwX3L2.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eoYqlqSKE381giHHxVafHa5eUDi.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":10846,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9ZNGlWhNhPwenG3Q6yNmSdwX3L2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9ZNGlWhNhPwenG3Q6yNmSdwX3L2.jpg","language":"it","width":856,"height":1285},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9ZNGlWhNhPwenG3Q6yNmSdwX3L2.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9ZNGlWhNhPwenG3Q6yNmSdwX3L2.jpg","language":"it","width":856,"height":1285},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7FswDcARkiDx0hpTAEe1JnlL6yg.jpg","prev